{"ref":"BDB, רֵחֶה","hw":"רֵחֶה","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">רֵחֶה</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>], only <strong>du.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">רֵחַיִם</span> (hand-)<strong>mill (</strong>prob. = 8<strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> abs., common household utensil, turned by maids, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 11:5\" href=\"/Exodus.11.5\">Ex 11:5</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">הָרֵחָ֑יִם</span>; J), female slaves <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 47:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.47.2\">Is 47:2</a> (c. <span dir=\"rtl\">טָחַן</span>, q.v.); <span dir=\"rtl\">טָחַן בָּר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:8\" href=\"/Numbers.11.8\">Nu 11:8</a> (J); <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳ וָרָ֑כֶב</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.6\">Dt 24:6</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, רָכַב\" href=\"/BDB,_רָכַב\", dir=\"rtl\">רכב</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹל ר׳</span> as sound of family life <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.10\">Je 25:10</a>.","next":"BDB, רחיטנו","prev":"BDB, רחה"}